\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Mixed As Peso Remains At Center Stage \b0\par\par\uc2  By Eric Van Zant \par \uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 2000\par 11:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    HONG KONG -(Dow Jones)- The Philippines peso remained at center stage\par in Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading Friday as President Joseph Estrada's\par political troubles pushed it to new lows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Once again, the peso's troubles pulled down \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in neighboring Southeast Asian markets, with the Indonesian rupiah and Thai baht falling in sympathy. The Singapore dollar was weaker much of the session but edged up late in the day. \par \par \uc2  The New Taiwan dollar also fell after a government decision to halt work on the island's fourth, and controversial, nuclear power plant. \par \par \uc2  On the peso, Rebecca Patterson, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist with JP Morgan, said: "Our yearend target (for the U.S. dollar) has been THB52.00, but the risks to this target are getting larger by the minute." \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at PHP51.07 late Friday, up from PHP50.34 Thursday, having hit a high of PHP51.30 earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  Dealers say they had been on the lookout for supportive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but none materialized. \par \par \uc2  And none may in the works, judging by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Rafael Buenaventura's comment that "monetary tools shouldn't be used to address non-monetary problems." \par \par \uc2  "It leaves one wondering what they're up to," said Patterson, adding that market watchers are still expecting action from the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if only to control the move in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rather than to stop it. \par \par \uc2  The peso's plunge spelt trouble for the other Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well. The Thai baht was trading at THB43.67 to the U.S. dollar late in the day, putting the U.S. unit up a touch from THB43.665 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  JP Morgan's Patterson said so long as the peso is in trouble it will be difficult for the baht to change direction. But she added there's been some decent two-way flow in the baht, and it's not under the same pressure as the peso. \par \par \uc2  She said the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could get up to THB45.00, although in far less dramatic fashion than the fall of the peso. \par \par \uc2  Against the Indonesian rupiah, the U.S. dollar moved up to IDR9,050, compared with IDR9,030 late last session. Against the Singapore dollar, it was trading slightly lower at S$1.7524, from S$1.7540. \par \par \uc2  Further north, the Taiwanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was having some trouble Friday after the ruling Democratic People's Party said it would stop construction on a fourth nuclear power plant in Taiwan. \par \par \uc2  The move has "revived concerns about political infighting between the KMT and the DPP," said Chi Lo, regional economist with Standard Chartered Bank, adding "with the scrapping of the plan, the battle is over but not the war." \par \par \uc2  Against the island's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. dollar was trading at NT$32.135 late Friday, up from NT$32.09 late last session. \par \par \uc2  The Korean won was up marginally, meanwhile, with the U.S. dollar trading at KRW1,134.8, compared with KRW1,136.5 late last session. \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dwar0571o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
