\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Unnerved by bomb-shaken rupiah, yen. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,642 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2000\par 04:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Sept 14 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah tanked \par \par \uc2  in early trade on Thursday following a powerful bomb blast at \par \par \uc2  the Jakarta Stock Exchange, dragging down other regional \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      At least 15 people were killed by the car bomb on \par \par \uc2  Wednesday, which sent bad vibes to a market already infested \par \par \uc2  with negative news. \par \par \uc2      "The market is sentiment-driven. People are rushing to cut \par \par \uc2  losses after these \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  skidded through one support after \par \par \uc2  another," said a dealer at one U.S. bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2      "But for various reasons, I don't think they will keep \par \par \uc2  sliding. \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fear in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines\b0 \highlight\uc2 , offshore baht \par \par \uc2  liquidity squeeze, and an increase in oil revenues in Indonesia \par \par \uc2  should provide some support," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The yen\tab   languished below the 107 level in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par absence of positive news to boost it.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The euro\tab   was mired near overnight lows against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar, with the market expecting only little support from an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ECB policy-making meeting on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     All 55 economists polled by Reuters earlier this week\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par predicted the ECB would hold rates steady.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah sank to its worst level in more than a month on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the back of solid dollar demand from both offshore and onshore\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par players.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Wednesday bombing came on the eve of the resumption of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par former president Suharto's graft trial, which many feared could\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trigger violence by his supporters.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "It might probe 9,000 in the immediate term. The sentiment\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par is really bad. But I hope things will settle down in the near\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par future because this clearly is a reaction to a specific\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par incident," said Simon Flint, regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of America.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Bank of America suggested investors stay long on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar/rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The pair is looking heavily overbought, with a reading of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 82 on the 14-day relative strength index (RSI). The overbought\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par line is 70.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht fell to 41.83 overnight -- a level not seen since\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par August 31, 1998 -- after a fall below 41.70 prompted players to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cut losses.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Strong dollar demand for commercial reasons and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par short-covering activity are expected to keep downward pressure\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on the baht, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However, the unit was unlikely to breach a key support of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 42 without bouts of profit taking as exporter offers were seen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 41.80-41.90.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Regional factors and political uncertainties in the runup\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to the Thailand's next election are likely to put the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on the defensive in the near-term.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar was weighed by the plunging rupiah and the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par weak euro which drifted near its overnight low.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said if the rupiah breached the 9,000 psychological\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par support or the euro sank further, the Sing dollar could test\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its July 24 year-low of 1.7515 soon.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "All eyes are now set for the 1.7515 mark, but there's also\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fear of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the authorities," a dealer at a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par European bank said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won kicked off the first trading day of this week on a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bearish note, taking its cues from weak local stocks and the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par easier yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     South Korea's financial markets were closed on September\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 11-13 for a Thanksgiving holiday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Traders said the won would move between 1,110.5 and 1,114\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on Thursday, with the upside capped by expected dollar demand\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from importers after the three-day break.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The peso slipped as the decline in regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par worsened market sentiment already negative on the Philippines'\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par deteriorating economic and political situation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said a large budget deficit, a long-running and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par embarrassing hostage crisis and negative perception of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par government's handling of policies were likely to keep the peso\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par under pressure.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  or rate hikes by the authorities have given\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the peso only temporary boost. It has further room to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par depreciate," a dealer at a European bank said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  several times since last\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par week and raised key domestic interest rates by a full\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percentage point effective on September 11.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar nudged lower due to a weaker yen and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fears of capital outflows sparked by increased selling of local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stocks by foreign funds.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Foreign equity funds, whose attitude is a leading indicator\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of the market trend, were net sellers of T$3.817 billion in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par local stocks on Wednesday, taking their net selling over the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par last seven sessions to T$17.915 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the unit was likely to trade in a 31.10-31.13\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par range on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0207 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     107.17\tab  107.80\tab    +0.59\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7445\tab  1.7435\tab    -0.06\par  Taiwan dlr    31.121\tab  31.112\tab    -0.03\par  Korean won   1113.50\tab 1109.00\tab    -0.40\par  Baht\tab      41.82\tab   41.60\tab    -0.53\par  Peso\tab      45.88\tab   45.65\tab    -0.50\par  Rupiah\tab  8835.00\tab 8720.00\tab    -1.30\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     107.17\tab  102.21\tab    -4.63\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7445\tab  1.6640\tab    -4.61\par  Taiwan dlr    31.121\tab  31.380\tab    +0.83\par  Korean won   1113.50\tab 1135.00\tab    +1.93\par  Baht\tab      41.82\tab   37.45\tab   -10.45\par  Peso\tab      45.88\tab   40.20\tab   -12.38\par  Rupiah\tab  8835.00\tab 6975.00\tab   -21.05\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.8000\tab    +0.01.\par \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah sank to its worst level in more than a month on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the back of solid dollar demand from both offshore and onshore\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par players.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Wednesday bombing came on the eve of the resumption of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par former president Suharto's graft trial, which many feared could\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trigger violence by his supporters.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "It might probe 9,000 in the i