tain that the peso - and other regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  - will\par correct," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Even so, with investor confidence in the Philippines at a low ebb,\par many \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  watchers expect the peso to continue trending lower over\par the rest of the year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso has been under near constant pressure this year on concerns\par over President Joseph Estrada's leadership - and particularly\par perceptions of a resurgency in cronyism.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Muslim insurgency in the south, as well as a number of economic\par worries, such as slowing exports and the likelihood that the\par budget-deficit target will badly overshoot, are also rattling the\par market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Buenaventura's comment that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hasn't \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  so far\par Tuesday may raise some eyebrows in the market, as traders believe the\par authority did sell dollars early in the session to stop PHP45.50 being\par breached.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Buenaventura reiterated that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was prepared to supply\par dollars during liquidity crunches but this didn't occur Tuesday morning.\par The exchange rate, he said, is "still market determined."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Buenaventura said the "good news" that U.S. interest rates have\par stabilized has been largely ignored by the region's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets,\par which have focused instead on political developments in Indonesia,\par Thailand and the Philippines.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Amethyst Ma, Dow Jones Newswires; 632-892-5590;\par amethyst.ma@dowjones.com\par -0- 05/09/00 0