\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Philippines \highlight\uc2  Buenaventura Says Not  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 2000\par 09:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MANILA -(Dow Jones)- Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Rafael Buenaventura said Monday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the peso. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura, speaking to reporters, said the authority also isn't targeting a specific exchange rate, a comment indicating that it remains committed to a market-determined peso despite recent heavy losses in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The peso hit a fresh 19-month low against the dollar of PHP41.880 in afternoon trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have indirectly supplied dollars to the market at around PHP41.80 to support the ailing peso. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is considering further raising its overnight borrowing rate to help stabilize the peso, stopping short of saying how large a rise the authority is eyeing. \par \par \uc2  "It's an option we are looking at and it's an option we will discuss with the banks," Buenaventura said. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will meet this week with the Bankers Association of the Philippines, the umbrella organization of the country's 53 commercial banks, to discuss the impact of a another increase in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight borrowing rate. \par \par \uc2  "There's really a basis for higher interest rates, but if we don't have to (raise the overnight borrowing rate), we won't," Buenaventura said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised its overnight borrowing rate by one percentage point to 10% last week to help support the peso and to align the key rate with higher U.S. interest rates. \par \par \uc2  -By Amethyst Ma; 632-892-5590; amethyst. ma@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010802dw5m00aht\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
