\par\par \b \uc2  IMF/ \highlight22\uc2 Philippines \highlight\uc2 /Ctrl Bk -2: Limit Direct  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 179 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 00:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'In pursuit of these objectives, interest-rate policy will be guided primarily by the targets established by the base money, while exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be geared to meet the targets for the NIR,' according to the memorandum. \par \par \uc2  Under the proposed adjustment mechanism, the base money ceiling will be adjusted upwards if there is an excess in the peso equivalent of the actual NIR level vis-a-vis monthly targets, or vice versa. \par \par \uc2  The adjustment mechanism was introduced in the last three years of the country's extended fund facility with the IMF. The mechanism aims to support a 'firm' but 'flexible' monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  The memorandum said even as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  turmoil persists, the Philippines will be allowed to maintain the adjustment mechanism to help limit direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in favor of the use of interest rates whenever the peso comes under pressure. \par \par \uc2  -By Micheline R. Millar; (632) 892-5590; mmillar@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  08-03-98 \par \par \uc2  2320GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010914du3800ch4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
