\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  In Renewed Falls As Pessimism Deepens \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1997\par 13:51\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par dropped across the board against the U.S. dollar during\par Asian trading Wednesday, as the confidence which drove last\par week's rally evaporated completely.\par    A number of factors across the region conspired to push\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  lower.\par    In Malaysia, investors began to unload the Malaysian\par ringgit after re-assessing their prognosis on the 1998\par budget. Last week's ringgit rebound, they decided, was\par over-extended given Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim's limited\par scope to introduce dramatic ringgit-boosting measures when\par he makes his speech on Friday.\par    At the same time rumors, that Indonesian corporations\par had defaulted on their obligations to foreign banks sparked\par a selloff in the rupiah, while the Thai baht continued to\par face pressure after the government's financial sector\par restructuring package, announced on Tuesday, failed to\par appease the market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    In the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Philippines\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was unable\par to prevent a cut in banks' liquidity reserve requirements\par from sending the peso sharply lower, as the banks\par immediately used the extra funds to purchase dollars.\par    Renewed pessimism throughout the region was deepened by\par the Hang Seng's dizzying 450-point plunge, which spilled\par over to weakening Southeast Asian stock markets. Amid the\par general gloom, the Singapore dollar also fell.\par    "The rally in the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was over-extended.\par Now exchange rates are re-aligning to take account of the\par fact that Southeast Asian countries are still in a phase of\par great vulnerability," said a senior Treasury economist at a\par major regional bank, asking not to be named.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  10-15-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0751EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtaf027jy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
