\par\par \b \uc2  Philippines/Ramos/ \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -2: Protecting Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 1997\par 06:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seeks 'to strike a healthy balance between \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates and interest rates,' he said. 'It is not just \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets for temporary relief.' \par \par \uc2  But active \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent days suggests the \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be weakening its commitment to the free float of the peso. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  abandoned in early July a costly defense of the peso and allowed it to move in a wider range against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Since then, the dollar has appreciated 24% against the peso. In morning trading Tuesday, the dollar averaged 32.786 pesos on the Philippine Dealing System, down 9.7 centavos from 32.883 pesos Monday, with the peso extending recent gains as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market shows further signs of stabilizing. \par \par \uc2  A system of volatility bands was introduced last week to curb recent sharp fluctuations in the peso-dollar rate. \par \par \uc2  Each time a limit is hit, trading is suspended for a cooling-off period for all trades outside that band. \par \par \uc2  Aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , coupled with \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves clearly marking the government's desired direction for the peso-dollar rate, has enabled the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to appreciate in recent days after falling steeply for much of last week. \par \par \uc2  But Ramos said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was simply a major player in the market, playing its natural role as protector of the nation's reserves. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a major player,' he said. 'It is very careful and protective of the national foreign reserves and must not allow the international reserves to get into a dangerous situation,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0405GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtae07ndv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
