\par\par \b \uc2  Philippine c. bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  tempers peso slide. \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MANILA, Sept 4 (Reuter) - The Philippine peso weakened to a new low on Thursday, but a modest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon propped the peso slightly at close, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The peso had tumbled to a record low of 32.43 to dollar in early session but was able to gain some grounds to close at 32.38. The peso ended at 31.70 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $21.5 million in afternoon deals, from 32.43 to 32.29, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  It was the first time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market after a week of absence. \par \par \uc2  Market turnover was moderate at $150 million compared to Wednesday's $200.5 million. \par \par \uc2  "Today, we saw a lot of inflows for stock market investments but the dollars were being gobbled up by banks," a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  "At these levels, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It's already at dangerous levels," he added. \par \par \uc2  The Bankers Association of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BAP) had asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  BAP president Deogracias Vistan told reporters: "A one peso increase in one day is not normal." \par \par \uc2  "I think there are speculative elements that need to be responded to when there is prevailing sentiment that the peso is consistently weakening." \par \par \uc2  Traders said banks may still test the downside on Friday due to the prevailing regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  situation. Some foresee it opening at 32.50. \par \par \uc2  "It beats me ... how low the peso will go. It all depends on the behaviour of the other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region," a trader said. \par \par \uc2  -- Lilian Karunungan (63) 2-841-8937; Fax (63) 2-817-6267 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: manila.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt9400b6s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
