\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Philippines \highlight\uc2  says it will  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  to defend peso. \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MANILA, July 9 (Reuter) - The Philippine Monetary Board said on Wednesday it would continue with its market-determined exchange rate policy and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  strongly to maintain an orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "The (\b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  strongly using all its available policy weapons to maintain an orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to penalise speculators," the Monetary Board said in a statement following a regular meeting. \par \par \uc2  The Monetary Board is the highest policy-making body of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is chaired by Bank Governor Gabriel Singson. \par \par \uc2  "The country's current flexible and market-determined exchange rate policy will be continued," it said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The comments come after a fresh attack on the peso, sparked by a Singapore newspaper report that Manila was discussing a possible devaluation. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to defend the peso following the report. \par \par \uc2  The Monetary Board said its exchange rate policy had allowed the country to strengthen its external balance of payments position over time and respond to unforeseen shocks in a timely manner. \par \par \uc2  It noted that first quarter GNP was a strong 6.1 percent, inflation had fallen to 4.6 percent in the first half of the year while exports in January-May were up 123 percent. \par \par \uc2  -- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841 8914 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7902rzm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
