\par\par \b \uc2  Philippines' Ramos operated on for arterial block. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Ruben Alabastro \par \uc2 578 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Dezember 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MANILA, Dec 23 (Reuter) - Philippine President Fidel Ramos successfully underwent surgery on Monday for a cholesterol blockage in a main artery that could have been life-threatening, doctors and officials said. \par \par \uc2  Ramos, 68, was conscious and recuperating well and was likely to be discharged from hospital on Christmas Day or on Thursday, doctors said. \par \par \uc2  "The president just called up and said that by tomorrow (Tuesday) he wants to get back to work," Executive Secretary Ruben Torres told a news conference about three hours after the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended. "He wants an office set up in the hospital." \par \par \uc2  "President Ramos is awake, he's smiling, he's listening to radio," Jose de Venecia, speaker of the House of Representatives, told reporters. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was extremely successful." \par \par \uc2  Raul Fores, the director of the Makati Medical Centre, said doctors discovered a cholesterol blockage "the size of a garbanzo" in Ramos's right carotid artery on the neck. \par \par \uc2  The carotids are the two main arteries carrying blood to the brain and blockages in them can lead to a stroke, officials said. \par \par \uc2  "The condition may be life-threatening if it is not removed immediately," said Health Secretary Carmencita Reodica. "That's why they decided to remove it right away." \par \par \uc2  Fores said doctors noticed a build-up of cholesetrol when they conducted tests on Ramos the previous weekend, when he was admitted to hospital for treatment of a throat infection. He said both Ramos and his wife consented to immediate surgery and a 75-minute \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was successfully conducted. \par \par \uc2  "The president is presently out of anaesthesia, awake and all vital signs are within normal limits," he said. \par \par \uc2  "The surgical team are confident that he may be out of the hospital either on Christmas Day or the day after," Fores said. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine stock market plunged at the open on news of Ramos's \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  but recovered marginally by the close. The composite index closed down 1.27 percent at 3,139.92 points, off a low of 3,112.56. \par \par \uc2  "In markets like the Philippines where the chief executive officer is seen as a very strong and powerful leader, the market is very sensitive on news about his health. There was a lot of foreign selling," said Raul Ruiz, vice president at Sun Hung Kai Securities. \par \par \uc2  "The market over-reacted on news of the surgery but rebounded a little bit in midsession on news that it was successful," said Felix Barrientos, a trader at ING Barings Securities. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stabilise the peso, dealers said. The peso was marginally weaker at 26.311/315 against the dollar at midday from a middle rate of 26.301 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "The market was a bit jittery at first, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quick to react," said Joselito Dalit, an analyst at the Asian Bank. "That stabilises the market." \par \par \uc2  Ramos is a fit, youthful man for his age, works up to 18 hours a day, regularly plays golf and is known to enjoy a twirl on a dance floor. But Fores said he would have to slow down and watch his diet, adding the president suffered from "the usual problems of people above 60". \par \par \uc2  "You get this illness from eating too much cheese and chocolates," he said. "For the first time, he has listened (to doctors advice). He realises he's got to slow down." \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019dscn0210l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
